WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.650
- We actually just had
Christina Applegate on.

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.490
- [Linda] I watched you guys

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:03.323
that was such a great interview.

00:00:03.323 --> 00:00:04.590
- [Kelly] I love her, and I wanted

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:05.820
to bring that up, like if you had

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:06.870
that support system in your life

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:08.070
because she explained that you were

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:09.420
part of the support system in hers

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:11.160
whenever she was diagnosed with MS.

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:14.370
And that's a hard thing to go through.

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:15.420
It's hard thing to watch...
- Yeah

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:16.290
- someone go through.

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:17.850
And she was talking about how hard it was,

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:21.120
like doing the last season,
like and just making it happen.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:21.953
- [Linda] Yeah.

00:00:21.953 --> 00:00:23.790
- What was that experience like for you?

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:26.430
- You know, it's just,
you just hope you can,

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:28.410
you know, nobody wants
to see their friends

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:29.460
or the people they love and care about

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:32.160
go about, you know, go through
anything that is difficult,

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:33.178
or challenging.
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:33.178 --> 00:00:34.939
- [Linda] And we always laugh

00:00:34.939 --> 00:00:37.029
'cause it kind of looks like
maybe a tampon commercial

00:00:37.029 --> 00:00:40.350
(Kelly and audience laugh)
or something.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:42.279
- This is why I want to call
her and be friends with y'all,

00:00:42.279 --> 00:00:43.112
(Linda laughs)

00:00:43.112 --> 00:00:44.250
'cause that is something I would say,

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:46.530
but I would find inappropriate.
But you said it, not me.

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:47.400
- I can say that though.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:48.233
- [Kelly] Yes.
- That's just a

00:00:48.233 --> 00:00:49.066
feminine hygiene thing.

00:00:49.066 --> 00:00:49.899
- [Kelly] No, I know but it would be

00:00:49.899 --> 00:00:50.732
inappropriate if I said it 'cause I'm not

00:00:50.732 --> 00:00:51.565
in the photo.
- [Linda] Yeah, yeah yeah. Yes

00:00:51.565 --> 00:00:53.100
- But like it's an amazing
after school special

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:53.933
- We can just superimpose you in there

00:00:53.933 --> 00:00:55.230
with like a box of tampons.
- [Kelly] Awesome, exactly.

00:00:55.230 --> 00:00:56.600
Thank you, I'll be the
Olan Mills on the side.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:57.433
(Linda giggles)

